[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15121.51, "timestamp": "04:12:01", "text": "分钟。你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15124.07, "timestamp": "04:12:04", "text": "所以，简单来说，我正在进行这项跑步比赛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15127.59, "timestamp": "04:12:07", "text": "只是为了资助 vub 的首次亮相和模型"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15131.11, "timestamp": "04:12:11", "text": "无论我们目前的情况如何，如果我们能够……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15134.469, "timestamp": "04:12:14", "text": "要实现这个目标，或者至少要达到这样的目标："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15137.75, "timestamp": "04:12:17", "text": "呃，至于索具，是960。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15138.75, "timestamp": "04:12:18", "text": "呃，为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15140.67, "timestamp": "04:12:20", "text": "索具"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15143.75, "timestamp": "04:12:23", "text": "嗯，如果我收到这个，我就可以开始我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15146.91, "timestamp": "04:12:26", "text": "索具工程的佣金"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15149.83, "timestamp": "04:12:29", "text": "但是，剩下的钱……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15152.95, "timestamp": "04:12:32", "text": "会去做一些出道作品。呃，我必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15154.63, "timestamp": "04:12:34", "text": "进行一次大规模的重组，对吧？我不能去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15158.309, "timestamp": "04:12:38", "text": "可惜的是，现在的体育迷们都这样，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15160.469, "timestamp": "04:12:40", "text": "这是高端型号，好吗？它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15163.03, "timestamp": "04:12:43", "text": "高端优质产品。我必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15166.389, "timestamp": "04:12:46", "text": "作为一名专业人士，我可以……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15169.71, "timestamp": "04:12:49", "text": "尽我所能成为一名专业人士"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15171.99, "timestamp": "04:12:51", "text": "创造者。我必须达到那种立场"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15173.63, "timestamp": "04:12:53", "text": "我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15176.87, "timestamp": "04:12:56", "text": "眼睛。所以，嗯，让我们尽力而为吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15178.67, "timestamp": "04:12:58", "text": "好的，我有很多东西。"}]